    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>本期详情</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>本期节目中，我们从联文开始发散视角，思考“努力”与“卷”的界限与平衡前行法则。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们也跟随着机缘链接不同的书本，体会文字的会心一击。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完本期读书会电台，你想从“美、树、平、界、链、正、雅”中抽取哪个字呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本条音频下方留言想抽取的单字，我们会随机选择2位观众赠送ta的专属文字内容～</span></p><span></span><p><span>（我们将在音频发出的两周内，于评论区回复入选观众，抽取的书目内容将有别于音频内内容。）</span></p><span></span><p><span>「界与桥」读书会（下）</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>关于我们</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7726653811" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7726653811"><span>@KELP克朴制素</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65003bfe000000000200f1f8?xsec_token=YBMtu5ihbtt4kFRF9R3mFSje5r8DeRskGLdYOxdtromj8%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=610e9110000000002002edc2&amp;apptime=1750376920&amp;share_id=7e9abec303fc425a96c376e0b5ab9e89&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65003bfe000000000200f1f8?xsec_token=YBMtu5ihbtt4kFRF9R3mFSje5r8DeRskGLdYOxdtromj8%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=610e9110000000002002edc2&amp;apptime=1750376920&amp;share_id=7e9abec303fc425a96c376e0b5ab9e89&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>@心向书言</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Bilibili：</span><a href="https://b23.tv/ybxPT3k" data-url="https://b23.tv/ybxPT3k"><span>@Kelp2021</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>网易云：</span><a href="http://music.163.com/radio?id=1225769588&amp;userid=87471687&amp;app_version=9.4.06" data-url="http://music.163.com/radio?id=1225769588&amp;userid=87471687&amp;app_version=9.4.06"><span>@KELP普通声音</span></a></p>]]></description>
