  <item>
    <title>vol.4 心向书言 | 倾听河流，成为太阳（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6911c6ed5acab5990bcdc984</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6911c6ed5acab5990bcdc984</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Nov 2025 11:09:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>本期详情</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>随着嘉宾们对《金花的秘密》的深入品读与感受，大家逐渐能够描绘出自己心中最渴望活出的状态，把握那份最恰当的人生节奏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当来到最为嘉宾熟知的《悉达多》阅读环节时，每一位像你像我像他的“悉达多”来到那条诉说密语的河流，又会走上哪一条娑婆之路？</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完全程，逐渐懂得了河水会如何用喃喃细语面对时间，太阳会如何用光芒普照面对阴影。终其一生，人寻求的和谐，兴许就是如河流般接纳，如太阳般闪耀。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>关于我们</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7726653811" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7726653811"><span>@KELP克朴制素</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65003bfe000000000200f1f8?xsec_token=YBMtu5ihbtt4kFRF9R3mFSje5r8DeRskGLdYOxdtromj8%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=610e9110000000002002edc2&amp;apptime=1750376920&amp;share_id=7e9abec303fc425a96c376e0b5ab9e89&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65003bfe000000000200f1f8?xsec_token=YBMtu5ihbtt4kFRF9R3mFSje5r8DeRskGLdYOxdtromj8%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=610e9110000000002002edc2&amp;apptime=1750376920&amp;share_id=7e9abec303fc425a96c376e0b5ab9e89&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>@心向书言</span></a></p>]]></description>
