    <guid isPermaLink="false">6911c5414619d9940c97eb4e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Nov 2025 10:59:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>本期详情</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>当巨蟹的意识之水与狮子的创造之火交融，会产生怎样的化学效应？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期读书会围绕黑塞与荣格这两位名人作家探讨了经由他们写作的三本书籍。在《园圃之乐》中，会发现黑塞种一棵树、看一朵云，其实都是在谈我们怎样在不安的世界里给自己造一个“家”；而在《金花的秘密》中，荣格强调的“自性”，又像是提醒我们：人终究要在日常中活出一点自己的温度。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>关于我们</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7726653811" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7726653811"><span>@KELP克朴制素</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65003bfe000000000200f1f8?xsec_token=YBMtu5ihbtt4kFRF9R3mFSje5r8DeRskGLdYOxdtromj8%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=610e9110000000002002edc2&amp;apptime=1750376920&amp;share_id=7e9abec303fc425a96c376e0b5ab9e89&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65003bfe000000000200f1f8?xsec_token=YBMtu5ihbtt4kFRF9R3mFSje5r8DeRskGLdYOxdtromj8%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=610e9110000000002002edc2&amp;apptime=1750376920&amp;share_id=7e9abec303fc425a96c376e0b5ab9e89&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>@心向书言</span></a></p>]]></description>
